 the World?\uff1f</h2>At the moment of destiny, what kind of path will the protagonist's belief lead to?",
    "short_description": "&quot;Artificial Wings&quot; is a story-driven game of romance, flight, and adventure. While exploring the old world, the protagonist crash-lands on Whale Island. There, they meet Liliana, a mysterious girl, and Ryan, a patrol captain. Drawn into their conflict, they uncover hidden truths and fate\u2019s ties...",
